## 🚀 PUSH WORKFLOW

### Step 1: Initialize Git (if not already done)

```bash
cd darivs-trust-nlnet

git init
git config user.name "Eduard Arbitman"
git config user.email "hello@arvend.io"
```

### Step 2: Add Remote

```bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/arvened/darivs-trust.git
```

### Step 3: Execute All Commits

Follow commit guide above in order.

### Step 4: Verify History

```bash
git log --oneline
# Should show all 9 commits
```

### Step 5: Push to GitHub

```bash
# Push all commits to main branch
git push -u origin main

# Or if you prefer develop first
git checkout -b develop
git push -u origin develop
git checkout main
```

### Step 6: Verify on GitHub

- Visit: https://github.com/arvened/darivs-trust
- Check: Commits, files, README renders
- Check: GitHub Actions workflow running

